																<span class="caption"><b><span  class="TabText" id="Table2">Table 2</span></b> Descriptions of publically available dynamic hand gesture datasets, following the order of <span class="xref"><a href="#Table1" ref-type="table">Table 1</a></span></span> 
																								<span class="caption"><b><span  class="TabText" id="Table2">表 2</span></b> 对公开可用的动态手势数据库的描述(与<span class="xref"><a href="#Table1" ref-type="table">表 1</a></span>中的顺序相同)</span>
															</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				</div>
				<br/>



											<span class="paragraph_title outline_anchor" level="1">3 动态手势交互应用</span>
																		<p class="Ident-First-Line">手势交互界面将推动虚拟现实、移动终端等研究和应用, 促进这些产业的发展.具体而言, 手势交互技术具有许多典型应用(见<span class="xref"><a href="#Table3" ref-type="table">表 3</a></span>).</p>
